00:01:10.189 --> 00:01:13.890
An H that's on here, and you can see it
like a little tail that's sticking out.

00:01:14.399 --> 00:01:18.480
Now the hemiketal, this is a, this
started as a ketone, so you can see

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:23.240
the carbons on both sides of it,
and it gets split into two oxygens.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:28.400
In this particular video, we're going to
